# Only what the server image needs; this keeps deploy/.env and keys out of the build.
*
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!server
!web
web/node_modules
web/build
web/.svelte-kit
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
server/internal/web/dist/*
!server/internal/web/dist/.gitkeep
**/*_test.go
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
